            "value": "Your public IPv6 address"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For this, Pingscape asks two services on the internet: ipify (ipify.org) for your public IP address, and RIPEstat (RIPE NCC) for the provider and organization. Each of them sees your public IP address, as with any request, and nothing else is sent. There is no server of ours. You can change this at any time under About.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For this, Pingscape asks two services on the internet: ipify (ipify.org) for your public IP address, and RIPEstat (RIPE NCC) for the provider and organization. Each of them sees your public IP address, as with any request, and nothing else is sent. There is no server of ours. You can change this at any time under About."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dafür fragt Pingscape zwei Dienste im Internet: ipify (ipify.org) nach deiner öffentlichen IP-Adresse und RIPEstat (RIPE NCC) nach Provider und Organisation. Beide sehen deine öffentliche IP-Adresse, wie bei jeder Anfrage, sonst wird nichts gesendet. Einen Server von uns gibt es nicht. Ändern kannst du das jederzeit unter Über."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ping ${host}": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ping ${host}"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "${host} anpingen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Network status": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Network status"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Netzwerkstatus"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reads the state of the network right now and returns it as text: connection, Wi-Fi, VPN and cellular. Nothing is changed or sent anywhere.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reads the state of the network right now and returns it as text: connection, Wi-Fi, VPN and cellular. Nothing is changed or sent anywhere."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Liest den Zustand des Netzwerks jetzt und gibt ihn als Text zurück: Verbindung, WLAN, VPN und Mobilfunk. Es wird nichts geändert oder irgendwohin gesendet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
